# Week 1 — HTML5, CSS3 & Responsive Web Design

## Project: Orbit Log
A mission-control themed dashboard tracking rocket launches, featured missions, and a mission-watch sign-up log. Built as the running project for this internship — designed to be extended with JavaScript (Week 2), React (Week 3), TypeScript + Tailwind (Week 4), and live API data (Week 5).

| Day | Focus | Status |
|-----|-------|--------|
| Day 1 | HTML5 Foundations | Complete |
| Day 2 | CSS Fundamentals | Complete |
| Day 3 | Modern CSS Layout (Flexbox/Grid) | Upcoming |
| Day 4 | Responsive Web Design | Upcoming |
| Day 5 | Weekly Project & Revision | Upcoming |

## Folder Guide
Each `Day X` folder contains:
- **Tasks/** — topics covered that day
- **Assignments/** — the hands-on assignment description and what was built
- **Project Files/** — the actual working code for that day

The most up-to-date, fully working version of the project is always in the **latest completed day's** `Project Files` folder.
